config MTK_VCODEC_SHIM
	tristate "MediaTek MT7623 /dev/Vcodec shim (prebuilt VPU userspace)"
	depends on ARCH_MEDIATEK || COMPILE_TEST
	depends on OF
	help
	  Minimal char-device shim that exposes /dev/Vcodec with the ABI the
	  prebuilt MediaTek armhf VPU userspace (libvcodec_utility.so) expects:
	  mmap of the VDEC register banks and DMA working buffers, the
	  _IOW('M', ...) ioctl family, SMI-larb power via a device link, and
	  poll-based decode completion. Intended for the BananaPi BPI-R2
	  (MT7623N) hardware video decoder bring-up.

	  If unsure, say N.
